# Testing Rules

- Test behavior and public contracts, not implementation details.
- Use synthetic fixtures with obviously fictional names and data.
- Cover Zod schemas, status transitions, and API error mapping.
- Cover PDF embedded-text path, scanned-PDF OCR path, and image OCR path.
- Cover unsupported file, size limit, page limit, and unreadable document errors.
- Cover invalid AI JSON and schema rejection.
- Cover source attribution and preservation of original input.
- Cover approval, return, and invalidation of approval after material edits.
- Avoid live AI calls in automated tests; use deterministic providers.
- Do not include real patient information in snapshots, fixtures, or logs.
